        "text": "那么第二种呢就是slogan，我要举两个例子，一个是迟早，一个是彪马野人",
        "representativeTime": 124.85,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-040.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012",
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 127.08,
        "end": 129.195,
        "text": "迟早就是打扮的美美的出门上班了",
        "representativeTime": 128.137,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 129.195,
        "end": 131.733,
        "text": "彪马野人就是欢迎收看我独自升级的一天",
        "representativeTime": 130.464,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 131.733,
        "end": 134.977,
        "text": "今天先讲到这里，我是人类最强编导，我们下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 133.355,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013",
